			"Message": "fix(Cocoon): Treat unknown method errors as benign for circuit breaker logic\n\nSigned-off-by: Nikola Hristov <Nikola@PlayForm.Cloud>",
			"SHA": "2137e2897e49758edd4d338f2cf2c002ff748576"
		},
